# Caddy на VPS — публичный край (точная рабочая копия 01.09.2026).
# Хеш basic auth НЕ секрет (однонаправленный) — пароль в хранилище владельца.
{
	# auth.peromebel.by добавим в шаге Authentik
}

crm.peromebel.by {
	reverse_proxy 192.168.0.20:80
}

staging-crm.peromebel.by {
	redir /telegram/finance https://telegram-staging.peromebel.by/telegram/finance 302
	basic_auth {
		staging $2a$14$loxh/pLiXQCMERQWX8BVc.F9H3fXOkXfgGZ/3MerSdyn/sGspnqhW
	}
	reverse_proxy 192.168.0.30:80
}

(staging-telegram-upstream) {
	reverse_proxy 192.168.0.30:80 {
		header_up X-Pero-Telegram-Finance-Only 1
	}
}

telegram-staging.peromebel.by {
	header X-Robots-Tag noindex

	@entry {
		method GET HEAD
		path /telegram/finance /_next/static/*
	}
	handle @entry {
		import staging-telegram-upstream
	}

	@session {
		method POST
		path /api/telegram/finance/session
	}
	handle @session {
		import staging-telegram-upstream
	}

	@workspace {
		path /finance /finance/* /logistics /logistics/* /notifications /api/finance/projects /api/finance/documents/* /api/logistics/documents/*
		not path /api/logistics/documents/upload
	}
	handle @workspace {
		import staging-telegram-upstream
	}

	handle {
		respond 404
	}
}
